WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:08.675
How’s it feel?

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:09.926
Heavy.

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:11.845
When I was a kid

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:12.762
I used to watch 
the Academy Awards

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:16.182
every single year, and so I never, ever thought 

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.642
I’d be at the Academy Awards,

00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:20.186
let alone be nominated,
let alone win an Academy award.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:21.688
Follow your dreams.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:25.108
I would just tell my younger
self that you belong in

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:26.484
the entertainment industry.

00:00:26.484 --> 00:00:28.194
And you're important
and your voice is important

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.363
so speak up.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:33.033
It's really, really hard
work. In the middle of all this

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:33.783
There was COVID.

00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:35.201
There were people
having to work from home.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.870
It was really hard

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:40.123
and everyone really worked
together so well to make

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:43.126
this movie what it is. Yup. Woo!

